This event serves as a crucial reminder of the importance of earthquake preparedness, emphasizing the need for emergency kits, sturdy home structures, and practiced safety measures. Experts urge everyone to identify safe spots in their homes, and participate in local earthquake drills to minimize risks in future seismic events.

